<title>USA: No major cold foreseen in Brazil coffee areas -WSC.</title>
<headline>No major cold foreseen in Brazil coffee areas -WSC.</headline>
<dateline>LEXINGTON, Mass. 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>No major cold is expected in Brazil's coffee belt, although temperatures are likely to be mostly below normal, private forecaster Weather Services Corporation (WSC) said on Monday.</p>
<p>The outlook is for scattered showers until Thursday, when clearer and cool conditions are likely.</p>
<p>Friday should be fair and warmer.</p>
</text>
